hronic) aquatic hazard","category":"Category 3","text":"Long-term (chronic) aquatic hazard : Category 3","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:classification:917ba362"}],"hazard_statements":[{"code":"H317","statement":"May cause an allergic skin reaction.","text":"H317 May cause an allergic skin reaction.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:hazard_statements:d4c10fb8"},{"code":"H412","statement":"Harmful to aquatic life with long lasting effects.","text":"H412 Harmful to aquatic life with long lasting effects.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:hazard_statements:b35e8c1c"}],"precautionary_statements":[{"group":"Prevention","code":"P261","statement":"Avoid breathing mist or vapours.","text":"P261 Avoid breathing mist or vapours.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:7895cfea"},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P272","statement":"Contaminated work clothing should not be allowed out of the workplace.","text":"P272 Contaminated work clothing should not be allowed out of the workplace.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:2222e81e"},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P273","statement":"Avoid release to the environment.","text":"P273 Avoid release to the environment.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:967777c8"},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P280","statement":"Wear protective gloves.","text":"P280 Wear protective gloves.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:87630ec7"},{"group":"Response","code":"P302 + P352","statement":"IF ON SKIN: Wash with plenty of water.","text":"P302 + P352 IF ON SKIN: Wash with plenty of water.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:153d8276"},{"group":"Response","code":"P333 + P313","statement":"If skin irritation or rash occurs: Get medical advice/ attention.","text":"P333 + P313 If skin irritation or rash occurs: Get medical advice/ attention.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:0c2e03d6"},{"group":"Response","code":"P362 + P364","statement":"Take off contaminated clothing and wash it before reuse.","text":"P362 + P364 Take off contaminated clothing and wash it before reuse.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:precautionary_statements:4732b4f8"}],"storage":[],"handling":[{"label":"Advice on protection against fire and explosion","text":"Normal measures for preventive fire protection.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":3},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:handling:3151dad9"},{"label":"Advice on safe handling","text":"Avoid exceeding the given occupational exposure limits (see section 8). Do not get in eyes, on skin, or on clothing. For personal protection see section 8. Persons with a history of skin sensitisation problems or asthma, allergies, chronic or recurrent respiratory disease should not be employed in any process in which this mixture is being used. Smoking, eating and drinking should be prohibited in the application area. Follow standard hygiene measures when handling chemical products","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":3},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:handling:de03b4b8"},{"label":"Hygiene measures","text":"Handle in accordance with good industrial hygiene and safety practice. When using do not eat or drink. When using do not smoke. Wash hands before breaks and at the end of workday.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":3},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:handling:ef026cd3"}],"signal_word":{"value":"Warning","text":"Signal word : Warning","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":1},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:signal_word:81c5033b"},"ppe":{"respiratory":{"label":"Respiratory protection","text":"No special measures required. Respirator selection must be based on known or anticipated exposure levels, the hazards of the product and the safe working limits of the selected respirator.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":4},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:ppe.respiratory:9e406749"},"hands":{"label":"Hand protection","text":"Chemical-resistant, impervious gloves complying with an approved standard should be worn at all times when handling chemical products if a risk assessment indicates this is necessary. Follow AS/NZS 1337.1 Recommended: Butyl rubber/nitrile rubber gloves. Contaminated gloves should be removed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":4},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:ppe.hands:27ef0e7d"},"eyes":{"label":"Eye protection","text":"Safety glasses","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":4},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:ppe.eyes:03ca7e7f"},"skin_body":{"label":"Skin and body protection","text":"Protective clothing (e.g. safety shoes, long-sleeved working clothing, long trousers) Follow AS 2210:3","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":4},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:ppe.skin_body:8701f223"},"engineering_controls":{"label":"Appropriate engineering controls","text":"Use adequate ventilation and/or engineering controls to prevent exposure to vapours.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/1/Sikafloor%2021.24.29.31.33%20Purcem%20Part%20A.pdf","v":"Revision 02.06.2022, Version 3.0","p":4},"id":"sikafloor-33-purcem:sds:e220b3:ppe.engineering_controls:b525b6f3"}},"transport_adg":null}]},"spec":{"ds":{"url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/w/sikafloor_-33_purcem.pdf","title":"Sikafloor®-33 PurCem®","edition":"April 2023, Version 01.04","version":"01.04","issued":"April 2023"},"std":[{"citation":"ASTM D 4060","section":"PRODUCT INFORMATION","page":2,"context":"1.57 g - ASTM D 4060"},{"citation":"ASTM D 3441","section":"PRODUCT INFORMATION","page":2,"context":"1.75 Mpa - ASTM D 3441"},{"citation":"AS 4585-2013","section":"PRODUCT INFORMATION","page":2,"context":"Sikafloor PurCem systems cater for and conform to a range of textures as per P rating AS 4585-2013"}]}}